NOTE ON TRAINED MODEL WEIGHTS AND DATA

This license covers the source code in this repository only. It does NOT
cover:

  - The CelebA-Spoof dataset (Zhang et al., ECCV 2020), which is distributed
    by its authors for non-commercial research use only. This repository
    does not include the dataset itself.
  - Any trained model checkpoint (.pth/.onnx file) produced by running this
    code against CelebA-Spoof. Because those weights are derived from
    non-commercial research-only data, they inherit that same non-commercial,
    research-only restriction and may not be redistributed or used
    commercially independent of that restriction, regardless of this
    repository's MIT license.

If you retrain on data you have the rights to use commercially, the
resulting weights are not subject to this restriction.
